SCOPE OF ORIGINAL WORK

Original to batchpress (MIT):

  - the append-only NDJSON journal and its fold/state machine
  - the crash-consistent publish protocol (staging file + rename)
  - the worker-thread slot pool, per-task timeout and hard-cancel handling
  - error classification and the retry policy
  - the disk-reserve guard and the output-size estimator
  - the resume path, including adoption of files published before a crash
  - aggregation into summary.json / summary.md / failures.csv
  - the CLI, presets, fixtures, test suite and benchmark harness

Supplied by sharp/libvips:

  - image decoding, EXIF orientation handling, resizing, format encoding
  - the pixel-level correctness of every produced image
